{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30005_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:49bd2a7f51460ebbb087c510d9e77df6b8f2b278dfb1735b6a73622e2cb42814",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5af13c01aaff6a6d69b4be8d09dbb86bddb30c00efd6819de76929463015c5",
      "text": "要说这个的话，柏木你不也一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:669bc8036db5758b067b7a1f524a64451913dab38cc634fe7732945bc1379934",
      "text": "毕竟酒量这种事，不到这种场合\n还真是不太清楚呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:985e2e470b31a60f5f9a4757fd5cd166b5c0658eee310fe9ced807646c2bbe15",
      "text": "不只是我，如果大家一起喝喝看，说不定\n也会有“原来那个人意外地很能喝……”这样的发现呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9599f358f07e1da8afee8fdce1cf837765ffe2b7d7627f3c85cdcba927477410",
      "text": "确实啊——……好。\n下次在能喝酒的这批人里办个酒会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08406e63b966a3aa0965675ff677a3ccc2525d68007427ce35c8bc292348e3cd",
      "text": "当然，由我来当组织者。\n我也想和大家多聊聊各种各样的话题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c355376adbb3d76c88466b8101c03773c1696a03372c685a23b4cb7b83094c9c",
      "text": "好主意呢！\n请务必让我也参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ceeb9ddbaef3f5ab6be385d4f8c2bfb9a729060d5a3b823a425b09d3ec67430",
      "text": "……如果我有空的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6e927d5a5dd739edb2b7cf7c5f093e36faf9479c971962c08e9d489c1856e37",
      "text": "好嘞，这就对啦！\n●●●●プロデューサー也会来的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f675bf459dad115f111230e4e131b563e131bac2ce0ce170e94d34eab7e45c6e",
      "text": "嗯！我也来帮忙组织。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67e2b1e00668719dcfe8cdebdeb9340af9df77baaa45b720892eb5bca47cefe3",
      "text": "多谢啦！……哎呀，\n杯子空了。再来一杯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:724cb42bb745c5d1c54231ac72ea69d026e227d18147ca09810b52617d3c88a4",
      "text": "喂……今天我虽然不说你，\n但演出结束后可别喝过头了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40f2648309a828fdd0cde31e84579ef9a2e85cc18d4ab4c5be1b86cce18f27a6",
      "text": "啊，我知道。\n毕竟之后还有重要的活动等着呢嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
